      "mergeID": "632de8f564080444a7ffd592",
      "mergedPostDetails": "This bug only works in VR since you can't see above your Main Menu in Desktop Mode\nIf the user goes to anybody's profile and scrolls down to either one of their uploaded worlds, or one of their playlisted worlds, then click on a world and then click the back arrow, it will cause the Users Bio to Appear where it would be relative to how far the user scrolled.\nIt is immediately fixed by simply scrolling again.\nI had to use pretty strong compression on the GIF to get it under the 8 MB limit.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[1240] [VR Only] User Bio Text Appearing When It Shouldn't",
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
